{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37148","headline":"愁诗 · 李廷璧","name":"愁诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到来难遣去难留，着骨黏心万事休。\n潘岳愁丝生鬓里，婕妤悲色上眉头。\n长途诗尽空骑马，远雁声初独倚楼。\n更有相思不相见，酒醒灯背月如钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廷璧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}